abstract: >-
  Versioned Python and R workflows, derived results, source tables, figures, and
  audit documentation accompanying the JGG manuscript on reproducible mouse
  endothelial responses to neonatal hyperoxia, cohort-dependent prediction
  rankings, and limited broad mouse-to-human transfer.
